<% content_for :title, "MAKEDOC Building - 프리미엄 학습 시설" %>
<% content_for :meta_description, "메이크닥 강남 본원의 스마트 강의실, 컨설팅룸, 학생 라운지 등 프리미엄 학습 시설을 소개합니다." %>

<!-- Hero Banner with Slider effect -->
<section class="h-[500px] relative flex flex-col justify-center bg-gray-900 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0">
    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497366216548-37526070297c?q=80&w=2000&auto=format&fit=crop" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-50" alt="메이크닥 빌딩 외관">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-gray-900 via-transparent to-gray-900/60"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="relative z-10 container mx-auto px-4 max-w-7xl text-center">
    <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 drop-shadow-lg">MAKEDOC <span class="text-accent font-light">BUILDING</span></h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-white/80 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-light tracking-wide">꿈을 향한 도전이 시작되는 곳, 학생 중심의 쾌적한 학습 공간</p>
  </div>
  <!-- Slider dots (decorative) -->
  <div class="absolute bottom-10 left-0 right-0 flex justify-center space-x-3 z-10" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="w-12 h-1 bg-accent rounded-full"></div>
    <div class="w-12 h-1 bg-white/40 rounded-full"></div>
    <div class="w-12 h-1 bg-white/40 rounded-full"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Facility Overview / Zig-zag Layout -->
<section class="py-24 bg-white">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-7xl">
    <div class="mb-20 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary mb-4">학습의 질을 높이는 프리미엄 시설</h2>
      <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-accent mx-auto" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Row 1 -->
    <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-16 mb-24">
      <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 relative">
        <div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-bg-light rounded-3xl transform -rotate-3 z-0" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1524178232363-1fb2b075b655?q=80&w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop" class="relative z-10 w-full h-[400px] object-cover rounded-2xl shadow-xl" alt="첨단 미디어 장비를 갖춘 스마트 강의실" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 space-y-6">
        <div class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 bg-primary/10 text-primary font-bold rounded-full text-sm">3F - 5F</div>
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-text-dark">스마트 강의실</h3>
        <p class="text-text-body text-lg leading-relaxed">쾌적하고 몰입도 높은 학습 환경을 위한 첨단 미디어 강의실입니다. 소수 정예 수업에 최적화된 책상 배치와 피로도를 낮추는 조명 시스템, 최고급 방음 시설을 갖추고 있습니다.</p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 mt-6">
          <li class="flex items-center text-text-muted"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent mr-3" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg> 인체공학적 데스크 & 의자</li>
          <li class="flex items-center text-text-muted"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent mr-3" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg> 대형 4K 스마트 보드</li>
          <li class="flex items-center text-text-muted"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent mr-3" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg> 공기 청정/환기 시스템 완비</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Row 2 -->
    <div class="flex flex-col-reverse lg:flex-row items-center gap-16 mb-10">
      <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 space-y-6">
        <div class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 bg-primary/10 text-primary font-bold rounded-full text-sm">2F</div>
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-text-dark">퍼스널 컨설팅 & 라운지</h3>
        <p class="text-text-body text-lg leading-relaxed">프라이빗한 분위기 속에서 심층 입시 상담이 이루어지는 컨설팅룸과, 학생들이 수업 전후 편안하게 휴식을 취할 수 있는 휴게 공간(Student Lounge)이 마련되어 있습니다.</p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 mt-6">
          <li class="flex items-center text-text-muted"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent mr-3" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg> VIP 지정석 상담실</li>
          <li class="flex items-center text-text-muted"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent mr-3" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg> 학생용 개별 보관함</li>
          <li class="flex items-center text-text-muted"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent mr-3" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg> 프리미엄 커피/간식 바</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 relative">
        <div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-accent/10 rounded-3xl transform rotate-3 z-0" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497366754035-f200968a6e72?q=80&w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop" class="relative z-10 w-full h-[400px] object-cover rounded-2xl shadow-xl" alt="컨설팅룸과 학생 휴게 라운지" loading="lazy">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Gallery Grid -->
<section class="py-20 bg-primary-dark overflow-hidden">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-7xl">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Photo Gallery</h2>
      <p class="text-white/60">미리 둘러보는 메이크닥 시설 전경</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
      <div class="col-span-2 md:col-span-2 row-span-2 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden group relative">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497215842964-222b430dc094?q=80&w=800&auto=format&fit=crop" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="min-height: 400px;" alt="메이크닥 로비 전경" loading="lazy">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 flex items-center justify-center">
          <span class="text-white font-bold text-xl drop-shadow">로비 전경</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden group relative">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572044162444-ad60f128bdea?q=80&w=500&auto=format&fit=crop" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="height: 192px;" alt="스터디룸 내부" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden group relative">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556761175-5973dc0f32d7?q=80&w=500&auto=format&fit=crop" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="height: 192px;" alt="소규모 회의실" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden group relative">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542744173-8e7e53415bb0?q=80&w=500&auto=format&fit=crop" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="height: 192px;" alt="그룹 수업 강의실" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden group relative">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517502884422-41eaead166d4?q=80&w=500&auto=format&fit=crop" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="height: 192px;" alt="멀티미디어 학습 공간" loading="lazy">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
